                h2.cg-section-title About Ciphergram
                p.cg-section-lead.text-left Ciphergram is a backend systems consultancy founded by engineers who specialize in Go, AWS, distributed systems, and AI-assisted delivery. We focus on infrastructure-level problems that affect cost, performance, and scalability—and on integrating AI into those systems so it behaves like production software, not a side experiment.
                p We work the way your CTO or platform lead would want: narrow scope, explicit tradeoffs, AI where it speeds diagnosis and implementation, and recommendations you can implement or hand to your team with confidence.
                h4.cg-subhead Why technical leaders bring us in
                ul.cg-bullet-list
                    li Deep Go backend engineering for services, workers, and high-throughput paths
                    li Hands-on AWS and Lambda experience—including AI/inference workloads on Bedrock and related services
                    li AI-assisted engineering that accelerates audits and refactors without skipping review or ops discipline
                    li Systems architecture spanning event-driven design, reliability, cost-aware scaling, and production AI integration
                p.mb-0 Since 2014 we have shipped and advised on production systems. Today the practice is focused: AWS cost optimization, backend performance engineering, serverless migration, and AI systems integration for SaaS and scaling startups.
